{"id":"432457","name":"牛肉丸萝卜丝汤","author":"尔东叶","authorId":"6100832","desc":"","cover":"images/432457/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"青萝卜","amount":"500g"},{"name":"牛肉","amount":"350g"}],"sub":[{"name":"油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"粉丝","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛肉馅加盐、胡椒粉、料酒、生抽、油顺时针搅拌上劲。","img":"images/432457/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"青萝卜洗干净。","img":"images/432457/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"肉馅中加切碎的洋葱、姜搅拌均匀。","img":"images/432457/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"青萝卜切成丝。","img":"images/432457/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"起油锅，洋葱入锅煸香后萝卜丝入锅炒。","img":"images/432457/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"炒均匀后将萝卜倒入煮锅，加适量水。","img":"images/432457/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入粉丝。","img":"images/432457/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"开锅后，将牛肉丸入锅。","img":"images/432457/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"煮至食材熟，加盐。","img":"images/432457/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加胡椒粉关火。","img":"images/432457/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"搅拌均匀淋入芝麻油。","img":"images/432457/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"搅拌均匀即可盛出享用。","img":"images/432457/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"此汤不宜添加多种调味品。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}